    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Conveniently Located Three-Bedroom Single Storey Cottage with Garage\n\nKinsella Estates Carnew & Gorey are delighted to bring to the market this unique three-bedroom single-storey cottage at Croneyhorn, Carnew, Co. Wicklow.\n\nOriginally constructed in 1935 and extended to the rear in the late 1970s, this charming property occupies a generous site extending to approximately 0.22 hectares (0.54 acres) and presents an exciting opportunity for purchasers seeking a home with space, character and excellent potential to further enhance.\n\nOne of the property's most appealing features is the combination of the existing three-bedroom accommodation, a substantial adjoining garage and a rear plot benefiting from separate access. The garage itself offers excellent potential for conversion to additional living accommodation, subject to any necessary planning permission and building regulations.\n\nWhether seeking a permanent family home, a countryside retreat or a property with scope to adapt and improve over time, Croneyhorn represents a rare and versatile purchase opportunity.\nThe property enjoys a peaceful setting while remaining within easy reach of Carnew's excellent range of amenities, including schools, shops, and local services.\n\nThe thriving town of Gorey is just 18 km away, while the renowned Coollattin Golf Club lies only 4 km from the property, offering an exceptional lifestyle opportunity for both families and commuters alike.\n\nA Rare Opportunity with Exciting Potential\n\nProperties offering this combination of location, site size, separate rear access, garage accommodation and potential for further enhancement seldom come to the market at this price point.\nEarly viewing is strongly recommended to fully appreciate the potential this unique property has to offer.\n\n\nEircode: Y14 P215\nBER: G 119681427 \nHouse Size: 73.3sq. mt (789.5 sq. ft)\nSite Size: 0.22 Hectares (0.54 Acres)\n\nServices:\n\nOil Fired Central Heating\nMains Water\nSewerage Septic Tank\n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nGround Floor:\n\nEntrance Hall: \n\nLiving Room: 4.6m x 3.4m\nSolid Fuel Stove\n\nKitchen/ Dining Room: 4.5m x 4.2m\nRayburn Cooker\nHot Press\n\nMaster Bedroom: 4.8m x 2.9m\n\nBedroom 2: 3.6m x 2.7m\n\nBedroom 3: 2.8m x 1.8m\nTimber Floor\n\nBathroom: 3.2m x 1.6m\n\nGarage: 4.7m x 3.9m\nWhich could easily be turned into living accomadation\n\nOutside:\nConcrete Parking to Front\nPlot to the rear with Separate Access\n\n"
      },
